{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "1d220516d974867e51de818c0ef6dd30e8dc1798bbff0e5afa4fe5e60f75bba7", "ja": "あっ、いたいた！\n{$P$}さん！", "zh": "啊！原来你在这里！\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1470f7f1b77bd8729a1f79eb684eb7eb13fc56a8bbb9f18d90e83461ca0c94af", "ja": "青羽さん、お疲れ様です。\nいやあ、毎日暑いですね。", "zh": "青羽小姐，工作辛苦了。\n不是我在说，每天都好热喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "652c37eac9f03815fb690768f57d591e266c0ad52a39c87d629e7e654d388302", "ja": "本当ですね～。{$P$}さんも、\n熱中症には気をつけてくださいね！　それと……。", "zh": "真的～{$P$}先生\n也要小心别中暑啰！还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ad469e298f39bd28fd3610ed3d6d045fa313968b90ae9067e38cbb4bdf6d6283", "ja": "どうしました？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "f7b934c719e0f55816973d80ec84cbd17f1109f90c297238167f658abab2e287", "ja": "社長さんが、またお呼びなんです。\nなんでも、夏らしいパワフルなお話があるとか！", "zh": "社长又叫你过去了。\n好像是有一件充满夏日活力的事情要跟你说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "5b1498aa58a3246731897d7204bf56df39cddd2cd23a730a966b5108a9857292", "ja": "へえ！　なんだろうな？\nとりあえず、行ってきますね。", "zh": "哦！会是什么啊？\n总之我先过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "35f9b495328159acd6fc8e7681788244ec15bbf4c68622e043bce30ad2664775", "ja": "はーい！　熱中症には気をつけて……あっ、\nこれはさっきも言いましたね。えへへ……♪", "zh": "好的～！小心别中暑……啊，\n这句话我刚才讲过了呢，嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1007_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bcc7be51f18e6b6380dd3c5adde14cdaff1dc702f61ffd3bd994a38689cb821c", "ja": "ふう、失礼します！　社長、音無さん、\nお疲れさまです！", "zh": "呼，打扰了！\n社长、音无小姐，两位辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1009_president", "source_sha256": "de388598c46d4eb6fe1bc34a810c4b05ebd6f025ce09f9183318b497e4fe4a9a", "ja": "おお、君！　早速来てくれたのかね。\n暑い中、ご苦労様！", "zh": "哦哦，你来得很快嘛。\n天气这么热，辛苦你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "499cf51223b4d821f50f40a61804f1e17595fe20aac40fd636d92bb568657c80", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！　\n今、冷たい麦茶を持ってきますね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n我现在就拿冰麦茶过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "25d9008db25d10eeb98d10a251d9912257f4e7f87f67607c91c6c26987f10c2c", "ja": "わあ、ありがとうございます！\nこう暑いと、喉が渇いてたまりませんね……。", "zh": "哇～谢谢！\n热成这样，让人口渴得受不了呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1012_president", "source_sha256": "299845198fc742cf36fa2586b902b325bc1d48a0a572524df7cdfbaf0769e4c5", "ja": "音無君の入れてくれる麦茶は、格段に\n美味しいんだよ。特に、運動をした後はね！", "zh": "音无泡的麦茶特别好喝啊，\n尤其是运动完之后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b5ea8bd8cc144980e12383a3515d27b742be9099d5fef280d26eb741bb9c93da", "ja": "えっ。社長、この暑い中、\n運動をしてるんですか？", "zh": "咦！\n社长，天气这么热还运动吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "72b8558409312b5370cd1503702650e89d632e4046f165169cec13578e870127", "ja": "うむ、そうなんだよ。実は最近、\nランニングに凝っていてね……はっはっは。", "zh": "嗯，没错。\n其实我最近很热衷跑步……哈哈哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "45d8788c1b4e2f43e1ef457f61c778ebff1d6fed8efa14ef41519605fa26b784", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、普段よりも一層、\n日焼けしているような……。", "zh": "原来如此，\n社长看起来的确晒得比平常还黑……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "ea4b8b19546b3c078e1d05b56a885c7de87901de8785016aa2b3f8f6df3de91d", "ja": "私はこの夏、健康的に運動をして、もっともっと\n日焼けするつもりだよ！　君も一緒にどうかね？", "zh": "我打算这个夏天要健康地过，要多多运动\n而且晒得更黑！你要不要也一起来啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ee5cc4d8473d9e8ea4bba4ecb61e00255cf14df4b82a2127f4867ae88152ce3e", "ja": "そうですね。プロデューサー業は\n体力勝負ですし、時間があれば……。", "zh": "说得也是，制作人是靠体力决胜负的职业，\n如果有时间的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "cca49c3e5fdd896fadc2b59076e3036573bda7d478f7677933da7ba66bd44c3d", "ja": "本当かね！？　いやあ、嬉しいなあ……おっと！\nところで、ランニングといえばなんだが……。", "zh": "当真！？哎呀～我好高兴啊……\n哦！对了，说到跑步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "d1f4d35ffd5c23b5c96ae95b694105e6589e440f32fb375dd01f787b7c227034", "ja": "実に夏らしい、元気な曲が届いたんだよ！\nさあ、聴いてくれたまえ！", "zh": "其实有一首充满夏日风情的活泼歌曲送到了！\n来，你听听看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c49f88bba3145195a652890b4e2db407a601118eabf12bf203e208462ead313a", "ja": "おお……なんだか活気のある曲ですね！\nこれは、天体公演にピッタリですよ！", "zh": "哦哦……这首歌感觉很有活力呢！\n这很适合用在天体公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1022_president", "source_sha256": "e49c6cb8a53d1cc6c944d3d7dac0e5d6e144dab92ed3d38e2f2f12aa68acfb4f", "ja": "そうだろう、そうだろう！　次の天体公演、\nそろそろやってもいい頃じゃないかと思ってね！", "zh": "对吧、对吧！我在想，也差不多是时候\n可以举办下一场天体公演了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1023_101kot", "source_sha256": "236ae40f1fd64133bb7168d8bca322671699cce0b8ff12f687d3c0776fba27a5", "ja": "お待たせしました、{$P$}さん。\nよく冷えた麦茶ですよ。", "zh": "久等了，{$P$}先生。\n这是冰得透心凉的麦茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1024_p", "source_sha256": "79763160bd775fcce1d5945fb39bdeb8a1274a13e218588a26917f8e54c15df9", "ja": "ありがとうございます、音無さん。\n夏はやっぱり、麦茶ですよね……うん、美味しい。", "zh": "谢谢你，音无小姐。\n夏天果然就是要喝麦茶呢……嗯，好喝。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1025_president", "source_sha256": "eaca0cdfc9fc54ce44dc6aac422629534021661274fcc1d84ecbe2ead45ae9dc", "ja": "そうだ。次にランニングに行く時は、音無君の\n麦茶を水筒に入れて行くといいかもしれないな！", "zh": "对了，下次去跑步时，\n把音无的麦茶装在水壶里带着，或许也不错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1026_p", "source_sha256": "19248d9c416b327ec37a9e29adfa3870120af734412a7be9aad8837386dc4fcd", "ja": "いいですね！　たくさん走っても、\nこの麦茶があれば元気百倍です。", "zh": "不错耶！有了这个麦茶的话，\n就算跑得再久，也能维持精神百倍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1027_101kot", "source_sha256": "192350de913b003aa916b2ba429022b88d4569d60b0bef4f57c667369ce42639", "ja": "あらっ、それなら、もっとたくさん作らないと……\n劇場のみんなの分もあった方がいいですよね？", "zh": "哎呀，那我可得多泡一点才行……\n也顺便帮剧场的大家多准备一些比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1028_101kot", "source_sha256": "f828337b18474b42dde562a7315d14488ddbbf347d3e7c5097c5128351da7c33", "ja": "みんな、この暑さでバテてるでしょうし。\n事務員として、できるだけサポートしなくちゃ！", "zh": "大家应该都被这个酷暑弄得精神不振吧。\n身为事务员，我得尽可能地协助她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1029_president", "source_sha256": "98c229bb775c4cef0ff9a093fbe0459d8b8be85a65dd0841453b842f9c4c7db1", "ja": "うーん、音無君は働き者だなぁ。\nよし、夏のボーナス額を増量だ！", "zh": "嗯～音无工作很卖力呢。\n好，夏季奖金加码！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1030_101kot", "source_sha256": "79e6a5608d8225e335bc0f22bb8586facc74e292ab28765fafa113b17cd571bd", "ja": "えーっ！　本当ですか、社長！？\nウソだったら怒っちゃいますよ！", "zh": "咦──！真的吗，社长！？\n如果是骗人的，我会生气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1031_president", "source_sha256": "1d7163982dbf297b15bf21b201b8e0d7096470b1fea238c726292da5d04f7fd8", "ja": "はっはっは、期待していてくれたまえ！\nこのところ劇場もいい調子だしね。", "zh": "哈哈哈，你就拭目以待吧！\n毕竟这阵子剧场状况也不错嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_1032", "source_sha256": "265871f95d450bafbb7ed121a8ee0475fbb43a583128975b4a02f58cb4350051", "ja": "社長！", "zh": "社长！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_2000_p", "source_sha256": "762d715af998a65a25579412dc830d635e8a7943519efc1c9f2ab360869bf778", "ja": "社長！　俺も頑張っています！", "zh": "社长！我也很努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_2001_president", "source_sha256": "03018b70748fb876e6b14b47205cd907df58c365022b55b3609791c0ea0e8a02", "ja": "ん？　うんうん。わかっているとも。\n君も期待していてくれ！", "zh": "嗯？嗯嗯，我当然知道。\n你也拭目以待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_2002_president", "source_sha256": "96e13f8cf796526309245cd2019a247cdc291f80eb9f7a6db56d5b58d2678012", "ja": "その代わり、次の天体公演も期待しているよ！\nああ、それと……ランニングの件、あとで連絡するよ！", "zh": "不过相对的，我也很期待下一场天体公演喔！\n对了，还有……跑步的事，我晚点再联络你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_2003_p", "source_sha256": "9dc03687d64eb8f9ced9475b346bb1052e56664289a50f25425c6fbf34f9f916", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好的，谢谢社长！\n拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0096_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0096_story_intro_2004_p", "source_sha256": "c3e64f325bc16df4fc52a8e4e6e83da14610900759e4746a4b3567381806b956", "ja": "（今回の天体公演も頑張らなくちゃな……\nなんだか熱い夏になりそうだ！）", "zh": "（这次的天体公演也要加油才行……\n这个夏天感觉会很火热！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
